{"id":"n18388-1-10","stage":5,"title":"고함 · 高喊","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18388-1-10-1","ko":"저쪽에서 느닷없는 고함 소리가 들려.","zh":"那边突然传来了大喊声。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저쪽에서","meaning":"那边","explanation":"저쪽：那边；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"저쪽","audio":"/audio/db084e1f145d7643d7ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75761","senseId":"1","lemma":"저쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느닷없는","meaning":"出乎意外的，突如其来的","explanation":"느닷없다：出乎意外的，突如其来的；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"느닷없다","audio":"/audio/65f894a0d0fe24337f63.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40401","senseId":"1","lemma":"느닷없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고함","meaning":"高喊，叫喊","explanation":"고함：高喊，叫喊","readings":[{"term":"고함","audio":"/audio/0275b30a6ba326377e10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18388","senseId":"1","lemma":"고함","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들려.","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"db084e1f145d7643","term":"저쪽","zh":"那边","audio":"/audio/db084e1f145d7643d7ae.mp3","entryId":"75761","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人远的地方或方向。","pronunciation":["저쪽"]},{"id":"65f894a0d0fe2433","term":"느닷없다","zh":"出乎意外的，突如其来的","audio":"/audio/65f894a0d0fe24337f63.mp3","entryId":"40401","definition":"某事十分突然，令人很意外。","pronunciation":["느다덥따"]},{"id":"0275b30a6ba32637","term":"고함","zh":"高喊，叫喊","audio":"/audio/0275b30a6ba326377e10.mp3","entryId":"18388","definition":"大声叫的嗓音。","pronunciation":["고함"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7bb1c330987b97258cf9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18388-1-10-2","ko":"사람이 있나 봐. 한번 가 보자.","zh":"好像有人在那儿，我们过去看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보자.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）；试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c9a362b24e0cb9bfa4d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.216,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18388","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好像有人在那儿，我们过去看看吧。","想要增强腿部肌肉力量，适合做哪些运动呢？","那边突然传来了大喊声。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好像有人在那儿，我们过去看看吧。","那边突然传来了大喊声。","想要增强腿部肌肉力量，适合做哪些运动呢？"],"answer":0}]}
